<!-- A mainline heading east (three lanes) with one RIGHT exit at node 2 and one
     LEFT exit at node 4, for the split audit (microsim.split_audit). Travelling
     east, right is south (lower latitude) and left is north. The right exit's
     way carries a turn:lanes tag; the left exit's does not, so the tag reading
     and the bare geometry are both exercised. Nodes 0.006 deg apart ~ 510 m. -->
